Description: lightweight X11 desktop: window manager, compositor, panel and tools
 KiDesktop is a small desktop environment for X11 (and the XLibre fork),
 built as separate programs that each work on their own. This package is
 the desktop itself (it also stands in for the old single "kidesktop"
 package); the everyday applications are in kidesktop-base.
 .
  * kisession - session leader and service supervisor
  * kiwm / kicomp - window manager and compositor (XRender, GLX, EGL)
  * xispanel - panel with taskbar, tray, menus and keyboard navigation
  * xisserve - launcher and pages (audio, network, storage, calendar...)
  * xisback, kiconfd, xiskeys, xismenu - wallpaper, settings daemon,
    global hotkeys, global menu registrar
  * kiconf - settings application
  * kitheme - one widget theme for GTK2, GTK3, GTK4, Qt5 and Qt6
    (Oxygen-like, classic and flat presets)
  * xisguard - permission daemon for the XLibre XNOTIFY extension
  * kimemory / kistory - clipboard and activity history
 .
 The panel, the Alt+Tab switcher and the GTK programs are reachable by
 screen readers over AT-SPI when the session enables accessibility.

Package: kidesktop-base
Architecture: any
