Suggests: ffmpeg
Breaks: kidesktop (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces: kidesktop (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: KiDesktop applications: terminal, file manager and more
 The everyday applications of the KiDesktop environment. Each one works
 without the optional libraries and tools it recommends, with the matching
 features turned off.
 .
  * kiterm - tabbed terminal emulator (answers x-terminal-emulator)
  * kifiles - file manager (split view, thumbnails, devices, undo)
  * kishot - screenshots and screen recording; records through its libav
    plugin (zero-copy VAAPI on XLibre/XiS servers) when the FFmpeg
    libraries are installed, else through the ffmpeg command
 .
 More applications (image and document viewer, system monitor, text
 editor, paint) are planned for this package.
